{"kind":"html","caption":"数字 2 和 3 分别映射到字母集合 abc 与 def，问题可以看成从每一列依次选择一个字母。动画用深度优先搜索展示“选择、继续、记录、撤销”的循环，每到第二层就得到一个完整组合。两层共有 3 × 3 = 9 条路径，因此最终得到 9 个答案。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>电话号码的字母组合</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}.section{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px}.section:last-child{margin-bottom:0}h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}h2{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}.mono,.key,.letter,.result,.path{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.input{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.key{min-width:48px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px}.key small{display:block;margin-top:4px;color:#9cdcfe;font-size:10px}.columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}.column{padding:8px 10px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px}.column-label{margin-bottom:6px;color:#9cdcfe;font-size:10px}.letters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.letter{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;transition:.25s}.letter.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.status{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}.card{padding:8px 10px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px}.card-label{margin-bottom:4px;color:#9cdcfe;font-size:10px}.path{font-size:13px;color:#d4d4d4;font-weight:600}.action{font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}.results{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}.result{padding:2px 7px;text-align:center;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:11px;transition:.25s}.result.done{color:#d4d4d4}.result.latest{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.rule{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#252526;font-size:12px}@media(max-width:520px){.columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<section class=\"section\">\n<h1>示例：digits = <span class=\"mono\">\"23\"</span></h1>\n<div class=\"input\">\n<div class=\"key\">2<small>a · b · c</small></div>\n<div class=\"key\">3<small>d · e · f</small></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section\">\n<h2>逐层选择：每个位置选一个字母</h2>\n<div class=\"columns\">\n<div class=\"column\"><div class=\"column-label\">位置 0 · 数字 2</div><div class=\"letters\" id=\"left\"><div class=\"letter\">a</div><div class=\"letter\">b</div><div class=\"letter\">c</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"column\"><div class=\"column-label\">位置 1 · 数字 3</div><div class=\"letters\" id=\"right\"><div class=\"letter\">d</div><div class=\"letter\">e</div><div class=\"letter\">f</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"status\">\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-label\">当前路径</div><div class=\"path\" id=\"path\">—</div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-label\">当前动作</div><div class=\"action\" id=\"action\">从第一个数字开始搜索</div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section\">\n<h2>已记录的完整组合</h2>\n<div class=\"results\" id=\"results\"><div class=\"result\">ad</div><div class=\"result\">ae</div><div class=\"result\">af</div><div class=\"result\">bd</div><div class=\"result\">be</div><div class=\"result\">bf</div><div class=\"result\">cd</div><div class=\"result\">ce</div><div class=\"result\">cf</div></div>\n<div class=\"rule\">路径长度等于数字个数 2 时，记录答案；随后撤销末尾选择，尝试下一个字母。</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst combos=['ad','ae','af','bd','be','bf','cd','ce','cf'];\nconst left=[...document.querySelectorAll('#left .letter')];\nconst right=[...document.querySelectorAll('#right .letter')];\nconst results=[...document.querySelectorAll('#results .result')];\nconst path=document.getElementById('path');\nconst action=document.getElementById('action');\nlet step=-1;\nfunction render(){\n step=(step+1)%(combos.length+1);\n left.forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));\n right.forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));\n results.forEach((x,i)=>{x.classList.toggle('done',i<step);x.classList.toggle('latest',i===step-1)});\n if(step===0){path.textContent='—';action.textContent='清空路径，从数字 2 对应的字母开始';return}\n const word=combos[step-1];\n left[['a','b','c'].indexOf(word[0])].classList.add('active');\n right[['d','e','f'].indexOf(word[1])].classList.add('active');\n path.textContent=word;\n action.textContent='路径已覆盖两个位置，记录组合 '+word+'，再回溯尝试下一条路径';\n}\nrender();setInterval(render,1800);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}